"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[451],{451:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/the-red-finger.png\\"\\n          title=\\"The Red Finger\\"\\n          author=\\"Keigo Higashino\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Hyundae Munhak\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2007-07-25\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9788972753940\\"\\n          rating=3.5\\n          tags=\\"mystery\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nThrough the dramatic device of a murder case, it shows the moral and emotional collapse of a seemingly ordinary family.  \\nThe mystery in this work seems to be not ```who is the culprit``` but <mark>how was this tragedy possible</mark>.  \\n<br>\\nIn this work, the culprit of the case is revealed at the beginning, intentionally showing that the author\'s core question is not ```who```.  \\n<br>\\nUnder the name of family, it depicts a cold situation where the most vulnerable member is sacrificed to protect the monster they created.  \\n<br>\\nThrough the work, the author seems to offer sharp criticism regarding the collapse of extended families, the problem of elderly alienation, and the absence of parental guidance."}')}}]);